  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972920,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was working for Nike, Jewish guy\nfrom New York."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976760,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he wanted 200 grand to consult for\nme for a month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980360,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I couldn't pay anybody 200 grand. I\ndon't know if I would do it now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984079,
    "dDurationMs": 5441,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I got smart and I invited them to\ncome to my house for dinner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988120,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, we had some beautiful women\nthere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990640,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the first 20 minutes, he was getting\nmad at me because I was asking him all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995079,
    "dDurationMs": 6161,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kinds of questions and finally he said,\n\"Mr. Cuccio, what the hell do you want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999320,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "me to tell you? What do you want?\" I\nsaid, \"I have a problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003480,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have number one company OPI, number\ncompany two company Creative doing 80"
