  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007480,
    "dDurationMs": 7560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "million.\nMy brand is private label and I can't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011880,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get around the 5-6 million.\"\nHe said, \"Let me ask you a question. If"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016800,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you are C Cola,\ncould you ever become Coke?\" I said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020880,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"No, because RC is the cheap brand.\" He\nsaid, \"Well, why don't YOU CHANGE YOUR"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024959,
    "dDurationMs": 7841,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BRAND AND START a different perceived\nvalue?\" And in 1999, I started Cuccio,"
