    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a day.\nI make a joke. Last week the Amazon guy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105679,
    "dDurationMs": 5721,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "came to the door with no packages and he\nsaid, \"Is your wife okay?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110440,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I said, \"Yeah, why?\" He said, \"She\nhasn't had a delivery in 2 days.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113760,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a joke. But as she says to me, \"Why\nshould she buy pee pee pads for the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1118280,
    "dDurationMs": 7720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dogs? Why should she go and park her\nMercedes in a parking lot and take her"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123280,
    "dDurationMs": 7600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time to buy paper towels? You can have\nit delivered free the next day.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128720,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So these platforms are changing\neverything. And the great part about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132919,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "being young\nis you guys are taking advantage of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136760,
    "dDurationMs": 7720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these platforms to build a business and\nyou're starting very small with no money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141960,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now you're scaling it up.\nQuestion's going to be, are you going to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146159,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do 6 million,\n30 million, 60 million, or 600 million?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151360,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rest is up to you\nbecause you have to take advantage of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155240,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things that are changing and the\ndifferent opportunities that are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1158440,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "happening.\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161159,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you expanded to 90 countries with\nyour product. Which country did you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165840,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "choose first and what was that\nexperience like trying to go expand into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169120,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "another market outside of the US? I\nchose Brazil first because Brazil was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173560,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the greatest challenge for every\nAmerican company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176919,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you don't know what protectionism is,\nBrazil for the last 30 years didn't want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181640,
    "dDurationMs": 7160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "free trade.\nBrazil put 100% duty forever on every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186760,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "product. So when you go to Brazil, there\nwas no Jack Daniel's, there was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190600,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brazilian whiskey. When you bought\nshoes, there was no Italian shoes, there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194800,
    "dDurationMs": 7680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was Brazilian shoes. So, I knew there\nwas 220 million people and it was a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200120,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "captive audience. It's almost like a\nbusiness mafia. The government runs it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204840,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you can't bring products in.\nSo, I started the factory there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209520,
    "dDurationMs": 7640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "24 years ago and this year we'll\nprobably do 15 million there and we're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1214600,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the only American nail company in the\nmarket. Just to show you the biggest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1218920,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shows in the world in the United States\nof 40,000 people. I just came back from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223920,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brazil there's 220,000\npeople."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1228040,
    "dDurationMs": 8040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I had to pick Brazil first because I\nknew that would be the hardest. It took"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232320,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "me probably 15 years to build it out.\nAnd I have to go every year. What did"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237960,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your mom tell you about about you in\nsales?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241400,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My mom told me\nfirst of all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246080,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when she was dying\nI asked her if she knew I was going to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250160,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be rich or successful. Why?\nAnd she said, \"That's why. Ever since"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255040,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you've been 2 years old you said why\n40 times a day.\" I said, \"Ma, I wanted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1260280,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to know why so I asked you why cuz I\ndidn't know why because I wanted to know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1263280,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why.\"\nSo, my mother used to laugh and say that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266840,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I could sell a cat off a dead fish\ntruck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1270080,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
