    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with no taxes.\nAnd you say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2384960,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I don't have the money.\"\nFind the money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2388560,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Borrow the money. Now,\nlet's talk about real estate. How did"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2392440,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you discover real estate?\nReal estate, you know, a lot of times"
