  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2396880,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you learn in life through life lessons.\nI used to own race horses and the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2401040,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Granatelli from STP, and a very good\nfriend of mine. We're in the box one day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2406960,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they were older, they were very\nsuccessful business people, and I was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2410440,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "renting my warehouse.\nAnd Larry Petrucelli said to me, \"Cooch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2415760,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do you rent your warehouse?\" I said,\n\"Yeah, why?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2418720,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He said, \"Do you pay your rent? Does\nyour company pay your rent?\" I said, \"Of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2422040,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "course I pay my rent.\" He said, \"Well,\nwhy the [ __ ] aren't you the landlord?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2426360,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I scratched my head and I said,\n\"What do you mean?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2429000,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He said, \"WHY DON'T YOU BUY A goddamn\nbuilding and pay yourself for the rest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2433160,
    "dDurationMs": 7400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your life and get the upside on it\ninstead of making somebody else rich?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2438000,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I bought my first building.\nThen I bought my second building. My"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2442560,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "last building I bought 22 years ago for\n4 million. It's worth 40 million. You"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2447400,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you got to tell me the story about the\nhotel room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2449640,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, this is a very funny story. In\n1987, two things happened to me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2454280,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I remember I'll never forget. I\nwould go back every 10 years to Inc."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2459120,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Magazine to meet a lot of the new\nentrepreneurs. And the first story is I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2462840,
    "dDurationMs": 7920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "met Sergey who had started Google\nin prior years and I was drinking with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2468360,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "him and he wanted me to put 5,000 to\nenhance the search engine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2472880,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the algorithms in Google. And I\nremember 2:00 in the morning, I said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2476720,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I'm from Brooklyn. I could beat\nanything.\" He said, \"Well, you can't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2479920,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "beat Google.\" I said, \"I bet you $1,000\nI never pay you a nickel and I have the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2484560,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first 30 pages of Google.\"\nSo, you know what I did? I went home and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2488360,
    "dDurationMs": 9240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I printed up a million cards in 1987\nthat say Google Tony Cuccio."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2494920,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now I have the first 30 pages.\nThat same meeting, and I didn't know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2499400,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what an algorithm was. I just let\nlaterally thought, \"How can I beat it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2503920,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If that many people punch my name in,\nI'm going to make my own [ __ ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2507160,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "algorithm.\" Right? The real estate is a\nfunnier one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2511240,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The guy who was number one, I was only\n377."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2515280,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The guy who was number one, his name was\nMitch Schlossberg. I think he's dead"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2518480,
    "dDurationMs": 7880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now. He was a Jewish kid from Cleveland.\nAnd at that time at 27 years old, I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2524320,
    "dDurationMs": 7400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never met somebody 100 times richer than\nme and 100 times smarter cuz I don't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2528880,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like being number 30 377. I wanted to be\nnumber one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2532960,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I was drinking with him and he and\nwent back to his room at 3:00 in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2537880,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "morning, he looked at me and he said,\n\"Are you gay?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2540840,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I said, \"What do you mean I'm gay?\nI'm Sicilian. We're not There's no"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2543840,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sicilian gay people.\"\nAnd he laughed at me and he said, \"Well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2547640,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why won't you leave?\"\nI said, \"Mitch, I have to tell you, I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2550840,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never met anybody that's that much\nsmarter than me. I want you to teach me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2554400,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "real estate.\"\nHe said, \"Tony, I'll teach you real"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2557280,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "estate,\nbut you're too stupid, you won't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2559680,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "understand it.\" I said, \"Try me,\n[ __ ] Try me.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2563240,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He said, \"All right, it's very simple. I\ncould teach you in 2 minutes.\" I said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2565800,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Teach me.\"\nHe said, \"Buy investment grade property"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2570240,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that has income.\"\nHe happened to own all the parking lots"
    } ]
